  "headline": "Methotrexate injection remains on FDA shortage list for 43 months with multiple manufacturers affected",
  "headline_cites": ["E34", "D6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the methotrexate sodium injection shortage on 2023-03-13 and it has remained on the list for 43 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E34", "D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Five manufacturers are currently listed with ongoing shortages: Accord Healthcare Inc., Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., Hospira Inc. (a Pfizer Company), and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA Inc.",
      "cites": ["E29", "E30", "E31", "E32", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. reports additional lots will be available in the October 2026 timeframe with product made available as released.",
      "cites": ["E31"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Teva Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. estimates recovery in October 2026.",
      "cites": ["E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fresenius Kabi USA LLC advises checking wholesaler for inventory.",
      "cites": ["E30"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records show a VAI classification for Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3007938603) ending 2023-03-24, 11 days after the shortage posting, and a VAI classification for Elite Laboratories Inc. (FEI 3002644678) ending 2020-03-13, 1095 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D4", "D5", "E27", "E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Manufacturing sites named on labels include THYMOORGAN PHARMAZIE GmbH for Hikma, PHARMACHEMIE BV for Teva, Elite Laboratories Inc. (USA), and Zydus Lifesciences Limited (India), though some links are noted as sponsor-only or not placed.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11", "E22", "E28"]
    }
  ]
}
